    fun focusRepeatSystem(): String =
            "A language learner is working on one recurring mistake. Decide whether any of the new corrections is the SAME KIND of mistake — the same grammar point, even with different words (a wrong past form is a wrong past form whatever the verb). A different point that happens to sit in the same sentence does not count.\nReturn {\"same\": true} or {\"same\": false}. When unsure, false."

